                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in">For more information</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">This notice does not fully describe COBRA coverage or other rights under the Plan(s). More information about COBRA coverage and</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">your rights under the Plan is available from the CSUF - Human Resources.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">If you have any questions concerning the information in this notice, or your rights to COBRA coverage, or if you want a copy of your</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">summary plan description, you should contact the following:</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">For general COBRA questions and questions regarding medical COBRA coverage:</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">CSUF Human Resources</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Benefits Unit</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">800 N. State College Blvd.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Fullerton, CA 92834</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">(657) 278-2425</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Questions regarding dental COBRA coverage</p></body>
